        "in_reply_to": "<CAGCUxmMAw4YffrTkgS+DD5Hgcch_YcmCxzheZk1JnRPV1mV2Lg@mail.gmail.com>",
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "Dear Tatyana,<div><br></div><div>It's Milad. I hope you are doing well.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for reporting it. There is an issue with the \"My Progress\" page. I have reported it to our tech team and I'll get back to you as soon as it is fixed.</div><div><br></div><div>Sorry for any inconvenience this might have caused.<br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Milad<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25878/7e27ee4403bdcd64\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25878/7e27ee4403bdcd64\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25878/7e27ee4403bdcd64</a><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Wednesday, October 16, 2024 at 4:12:45 PM, Tatyana Bidopia wrote:<br><br><div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Faham,</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">I hope you are doing well!!</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">I wanted to reach out because we have had a couple of participants have difficulties opening their “My Progress” page to determine which surveys they’ve completed and have left to complete. I just re-joined the study to see what was happening and this is a screenshot of what the “My Progress” page shows:</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<br><div><img src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25878/79623/134440?view=inline\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-width:100%;max-width: 100%;\"></div>\n<br><div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Please advise on what the issue might be and how it can be fixed.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Best,</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Tatyana</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">--<br>Tatyana Bidopia, MA<br>Doctoral Candidate, Clinical Psychology<br>Fordham University<br>Pronouns: she/her/hers<br><a href=\"mailto:tbidopia@fordham.edu\">tbidopia@fordham.edu</a><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<br><br>\n</div>",
