        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div dir=\"auto\">Thank you very much!!<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">--<br>Tatyana Bidopia, MA<br>Doctoral Candidate, Clinical Psychology<br>Fordham University<br>Pronouns: she/her/hers<br><a href=\"mailto:tbidopia@fordham.edu\">tbidopia@fordham.edu</a><br>\n</div>\n</div><div> </div><div>\n<br><div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">El El mar, oct 22, 2024 a la(s) 4:36 a.m., Milad Moosavi &lt;<a href=\"mailto:support@avicennaresearch.com\">support@avicennaresearch.com</a>&gt; escribió:<br>\n</div>\n<blockquote>\n\n<div>Hi Tatyana,<div> </div>\n<div>I just wanted to let you know that the issue has been resolved.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Thanks for your patience.</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><div>\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Milad<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25878/7e27ee4403bdcd64\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25878/7e27ee4403bdcd64\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25878/7e27ee4403bdcd64</a><br>\n</div>\n<div> <span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span>\n</div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div>4109 - <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/295+Adelaide+St+W,+Toronto,+ON+M5V+0L4,+Canada?entry=gmail&amp;source=g\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/295+Adelaide+St+W,+Toronto,+ON+M5V+0L4,+Canada?entry=gmail&amp;source=g\" target=\"_blank\">295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</a>\n</div>\n<div>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@avicennaresearch.com\">support@avicennaresearch.com</a> - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Wednesday, October 16, 2024 at 4:12:45 PM, Tatyana Bidopia wrote:<br><br><div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Faham,</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">I hope you are doing well!!</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">I wanted to reach out because we have had a couple of participants have difficulties opening their “My Progress” page to determine which surveys they’ve completed and have left to complete. I just re-joined the study to see what was happening and this is a screenshot of what the “My Progress” page shows:</div>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n<br>\n<br><div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Please advise on what the issue might be and how it can be fixed.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Best,</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">Tatyana</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">--<br>Tatyana Bidopia, MA<br>Doctoral Candidate, Clinical Psychology<br>Fordham University<br>Pronouns: she/her/hers<br><a href=\"mailto:tbidopia@fordham.edu\">tbidopia@fordham.edu</a><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div>\n<div> </div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>",
